  - m_Id: 1681675857937
    m_Localized: '<b>Camera</b>  Drag the map or use WASD / arrow keys.

      <b>Zoom</b>  Mouse wheel. RETURN TO BASE and GO TO ROVER reposition the view; FOLLOW tracks the rover.

      <b>Explore</b>  Click terrain to send the rover there and reveal sectors. Click a signal to survey it.

      <b>Build</b>  Open BUILD. Choose a blueprint and click a valid sector, or drag a card onto the map. Esc or right-click cancels.

      <b>Astronauts</b>  Open ASTRONAUTS, choose a person and then a facility. Working increases its output; tired astronauts rest automatically.

      <b>Walls</b>  Choose walls in the menu and place each on an empty sector (1 Fe). Neighbors connect automatically; Esc cancels.

      <b>Minimap</b>  Click an explored area to center the camera without moving the rover. + / - changes size; < > moves it to the other side.

      <b>Pause</b>  Esc or the PAUSE button.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1681675857938
    m_Localized: '{0} broke down. Send the rover to repair it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
